{
  "semantics": {
    "attributes": {
      "final": {},
      "header": {}
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Each document holds a set of name-value pairs called document attributes. These attributes provide a means of configuring the AsciiDoc processor, declaring document metadata, and defining reusable content. This page introduces document attributes and answers some questions about the terminology used when referring to them."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Document attributes are effectively document-scoped variables for the AsciiDoc language. The AsciiDoc language defines a set of built-in attributes, and also allows the author (or extensions) to define additional document attributes, which may replace built-in attributes when permitted."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Built-in attributes either provide access to read-only information about the document and its environment or allow the author to configure behavior of the AsciiDoc processor for a whole document or select regions. Built-in attributes are effectively unordered. User-defined attribute serve as a powerful text replacement tool. User-defined attributes are stored in the order in which they are defined."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Here’s a summary of some of the things document attributes are used for:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Provide access to document information"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Define document metadata"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Turn on or turn off built-in features"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Configure built-in features"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Declare the location of assets, like images"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Store content for reuse throughout a document"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Let’s look closer at the different types of document attributes."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_what_are_document_attributes",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "What are document attributes?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Document attributes fall into the following groups."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "dlist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "context": "paragraph",
                      "id": null,
                      "inlines": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "Boolean attributes are a subgroup of the built-in attribute. If a boolean attribute is defined, but not given a value (i.e., set), it’s in the \"on\" state. If the attribute is not defined (i.e., not set), it’s in the \"off\" state. In that regard, these attributes act as a switch. Their sole function is to turn on or turn off a feature."
                        }
                      ],
                      "roles": [],
                      "title": null
                    }
                  ],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Built-in attributes add, configure, and control common features in a document. Many built-in attributes only take effect when defined in the document header with an attribute entry."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "Built-in attributes"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              },
              {
                "description": {
                  "blocks": [],
                  "checkbox": null,
                  "inlines": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "A user-defined attribute is any attribute that the author sets that isn’t reserved by the AsciiDoc language or an extension. Most of the time, user-defined attributes are used as a text replacement tool. These attributes allow the author to define named, reusable content. Thus, instead of having to repeat text throughout the document, such as a product name, that text can be defined in an attribute and referenced by its name instead. This technique helps to keep the document DRY, which stands for “Don’t Repeat Yourself”."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "terms": [
                  [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "User-defined attributes"
                    }
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_types_of_document_attributes",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Types of document attributes"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "have default values in the case of built-in attributes"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "have no value in the case of boolean attributes and built-in attributes with default values"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "have a single line value"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "have a value that "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "spans multiple, contiguous lines"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "wrap-values.html"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "context": "ulist",
                    "id": null,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "blocks": [],
                        "checkbox": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "attribute references"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "blocks": [],
                        "checkbox": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "text formatting (if wrapped in a "
                          },
                          {
                            "inlines": [
                              {
                                "kind": "text",
                                "value": "pass macro"
                              }
                            ],
                            "kind": "xref",
                            "target": "pass:pass-macro.html#inline-pass"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": ")"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "blocks": [],
                        "checkbox": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "inline macros (if wrapped in a "
                          },
                          {
                            "inlines": [
                              {
                                "kind": "text",
                                "value": "pass macro"
                              }
                            ],
                            "kind": "xref",
                            "target": "pass:pass-macro.html#inline-pass"
                          },
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": ")"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "roles": [],
                    "style": null,
                    "title": null
                  }
                ],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "have a value that includes basic inline AsciiDoc syntax, such as:"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "But there are certain limitations to be aware of. Document attributes cannot:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "context": "ulist",
                    "id": null,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "blocks": [],
                        "checkbox": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "lists"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "blocks": [],
                        "checkbox": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "multiple paragraphs"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "blocks": [],
                        "checkbox": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "blocks (tables, sidebars, examples, etc)"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "blocks": [],
                        "checkbox": null,
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "other whitespace-dependent markup"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ],
                    "roles": [],
                    "style": null,
                    "title": null
                  }
                ],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "have a value that includes AsciiDoc block content, such as:"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_what_does_defining_a_document_attribute_mean",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "What does defining a document attribute mean?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "be set (turned on)"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_what_does_setting_a_document_attribute_mean",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "What does setting a document attribute mean?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "be unset (turned off) with a leading (preferred) or trailing "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "!"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " added to the name"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_what_does_unsetting_a_document_attribute_mean",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "What does unsetting a document attribute mean?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Document attributes can be declared in the:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "document header as an "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "attribute entry"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "attribute-entries.html"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "document body as an "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "attribute entry"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "attribute-entries.html"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "API via the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": ":attributes"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " option"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "CLI via the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "-a"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " option"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "override locked attributes assigned from the command line"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_where_are_document_attributes_defined_set_and_unset",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Where are document attributes defined, set, and unset?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Referencing a document attribute means replacing an attribute name with that attribute’s value. A document attribute can be referenced in the document using the syntax "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "{name}"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", where "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "name"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is the name of the attribute."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_what_does_referencing_a_document_attribute_mean",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "What does referencing a document attribute mean?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "A document attribute can be referenced anywhere in the document where the attributes substitution is applied. Generally speaking, the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "attributes substitution"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "subs:attributes.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is applied to the value of an attribute entry, titles, paragraph text, list text, the value of an element attribute, and the target of a macro."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "A document attribute can only be referenced after it has been defined."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_where_can_document_attributes_be_referenced",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Where can document attributes be referenced?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "outline": null,
